Business Development Executive focused on the Independent Financial Adviser (IFA) market required by a fast growing FinTech investment management company.

This is a remote working opportunity to join a growing business with a strong reputation, an uncapped bonus structure and a genuine career path into a Business Development Manager position. Working with warm leads generated through marketing activity and industry events, you'll build relationships with financial advisers and help grow assets across your region.

We're looking for someone who already understands the B2B IFA market, enjoys building long term relationships and is motivated to develop opportunities rather than simply make sales.

What We're Looking For

• Experience B2B selling to IFAs.

• Knowledge of MPS, Multi Asset or Investment Management.

• A consultative approach to business development.

• Based in the South of England (anywhere south of Birmingham)

• Happy to attend business meetings and represent at trade shows and events

• Confidence building relationships and converting opportunities.

• Ambition to progress your career.

If you already have experience working with IFAs as a B2B Business Development Executive, or similar, and are looking for a role where you can build relationships, develop your career and be rewarded for your success, we'd like to hear from you.

Apply today for a confidential discussion.

TAKE THIS PATH

Experimentation Consultant (1215)

£50,000 - £60,000

United Kingdom

Remote

TAKE THIS PATH
Job Type

Permanent

