Principal Software Developer (FileMaker) required to lead design and development across global enterprise systems within the travel, entertainment and events technology sector. This senior role combines deep FileMaker expertise with wider C#, .NET and Azure integration, providing architectural direction, mentoring developers, and ensuring scalability, performance and code excellence.

You’ll design and optimise FileMaker applications, implement distributed and API-driven solutions, and guide technical delivery across cross-functional product teams.

Essential experience:
• FileMaker Pro – database design, scripting, UI/UX, data relationships

• FileMaker Server deployment, performance optimisation and automation

• Security and permissions, AD integration, encryption at rest/in transit

• External data integration via ODBC, RESTful API, message-based architecture

• C#/.NET Core development and Azure Functions

• CI/CD, GitHub, Docker, unit testing, source/version control

• Agile delivery and team mentoring

Desirable:
• Azure APIM, Cosmos DB, Blob/Table Storage, Graph API

• Entity Framework, relational and non-relational databases

• Postman, Selenium, Playwright

• Awareness of OWASP, PCI v4, licensing and IP management

• Microsoft certifications

• Experience in travel or entertainment technology

Apply today to lead and deliver FileMaker and Azure solutions shaping the company's global systems landscape.

TAKE THIS PATH

Product Lead (1212)

£60,000 - £75,000

United Kingdom

Remote

TAKE THIS PATH
Job Type

