Central London, near Bank station
Hybrid, 4 days remote
Permanent: £90-£110k + Benefits

A financial institution is building its Azure platform and moving from on premises infrastructure to cloud. The team needs a Senior Platform Engineer who has been involved at the beginning of a platform build or migration, taken ownership of delivery, and helped move the work forward.

The role
• Build and develop the platform as part of a relatively new team.

• Help migrate infrastructure and services from on premises to cloud.

• Take technical ownership of platform development and migration work.

• Use Azure, Terraform, Kubernetes, containerisation and orchestration in platform delivery.

• Maintain service availability, fault tolerance and business continuity during change.

• Apply practical engineering judgement to progress the transformation.

Requirements
• Strong, hands on Azure platform and infrastructure experience.

• Experience building a platform from its early stages.

• On-premises to Azure cloud migration experience.

• Terraform, Kubernetes, containerisation and orchestration.

• Experience keeping systems resilient and services running during platform change.

• Experience working in a regulated environment.

• Financial services experience is useful, but is not required.

Apply Now!

