Football Interest Essential⚽🏆

An experienced mid to senior level SEO Executive is required by a fast-growing, football-focused sports betting platform.

This is a rare opportunity for a technology-led, B2C SEO professional with a real passion for football to combine their profession and their sports obsession into one role.

Working closely with a highly engaged football audience, you'll play a key role in understanding user behaviour, improving organic visibility and driving growth through search.

You'll be joining at an exciting stage in the company's growth, with significant opportunity to make an impact within an SEO channel that remains largely underexploited and full of potential.

What you'll do:

• Grow rankings, traffic and commercial performance across multiple websites.

• Optimise commercial and editorial content to improve organic visibility.

• Improve technical SEO, internal linking and site architecture.

• Support authority growth through backlink and digital PR activity.

• Monitor performance and identify opportunities for growth.

• Explore opportunities across AI search platforms including ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity and Google's AI Overviews.

What we're looking for:

• 2 to 5 years of performance focused SEO experience within affiliate marketing or digital publishing.

• A genuine passion for football.

• Experience across content, technical and off-page SEO.

• Comfortable using Google Search Console, Semrush and similar SEO tools.

• A genuine interest in AI, emerging search technologies and how search behaviour is evolving.

• Experience of iGaming would be useful but not essential - the combo of football and SEO tech/AI is more important!

TAKE THIS PATH

Senior SEO Manager (1213)

£60,000 - £80,000

United Kingdom

Remote

TAKE THIS PATH
Job Type

Permanent

